        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_luo_bo_jun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is an enormous dragon with a golden horn, three claws, and dragon eyes burning like lanterns.",
      "chapters": [
        541
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan kills Cheng Hu, a three-clawed golden horn dragon blocks the way for revenge as Cheng Hu’s big brother Cheng Long. Fang Yuan smashes him down in one collision and leaves him with a broken horn in a pit.",
      "chapters": [
        541
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "imperial-court-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_cheng_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Cheng Long crawls out, clears nearby foes, and pursues again; Fang Yuan blinds him in the air, hammers the dragon head to pieces, and the corpse stays in dragon form after death.",
